    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Game</h2><strong>&quot;Get rid of the butlers to complete the task!&quot;</strong><br><br> is a puzzle adventure game that solves various puzzles and fulfills all tasks.<br>You go on a journey where you have to be a cat, a powder agent, and remove all the butlers from the map.<br><br>Living in a neat cafe, 'Powder' is a playful cute cat.<br>Inside the dark store after everyone gets off work.<br>Curious of the twinkling light from the bookshelf, the powder approached close,<br>I look at the shiny miniature assemblies, and the space starts to become distorted and I start to lose consciousness.<br>When I came to my senses, I suddenly became the main character of the miniature world.<br>Now, Garu, who is an agent in another world, tries to escape from this world by solving the mission one by one.<br>What's important is the unbroken heart... Will they be able to escape?",
